                "category": "defensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>When Azotixo dies, he explodes in a burst of psychic energy. All creatures in a @Template[type:emanation|distance:10] take @Damage[12d6[mental]|options:area-damage] damage (@Check[will|dc:27|basic|options:area-effect] save). His possessions are left in a pile where he died.</p>"
